@startuml
title Diagram 9 — Alur Integrasi AI (M10 AI Assistance Layer, MVP Minimal)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

actor "Sales Rep" as SALES
participant "Core CRM\n(M2/M3/M4 — mandatory)" as CORE
participant "M8 Webhook\n(event outbound)" as HOOK
participant "M10 AI Assistance Layer\n(service terpisah)" as AI
participant "Model LLM\n(penyedia — TD-07/Q-040)" as LLM
database "Data Tenant\n(OB-032 hasil AI)" as DB

SALES -> CORE : buka Lead / Peluang
CORE -> HOOK : pancarkan event (record berubah)
HOOK -> AI : kirim event (async — DEC-030)
AI -> CORE : ambil konteks record (API core)
note right of AI
  Konteks WAJIB dibatasi
  pada tenant terkait
  (BR-003 / BR-045)
end note
AI -> LLM : kirim prompt (konteks tenant)
LLM --> AI : draf pesan / ringkasan & insight
AI -> DB : simpan hasil AI pada record tenant\n(OB-032)
DB --> CORE : hasil terbaca modul sales
SALES -> CORE : lihat draf / ringkasan (hasil AI)

alt Model LLM tidak tersedia / timeout
  AI --> HOOK : catat kegagalan pada jejak pemanggilan AI
  note right of AI
    Kegagalan AI TIDAK memblokir
    proses sales di core —
    AI adalah layanan terpisah
    (DEC-012)
  end note
end

legend bottom
  **MVP minimal (CR-20261008-002):** 1-2 use case *generatif* —
  AI-01 draf pesan outreach, AI-02 ringkasan & AI insight record.

  **Fase roadmap (EP-016, bukan MVP):** lead scoring prediktif,
  win probability, sales forecast — butuh data historis tenant.

  **Input arsitektur (TD-07):** core perlu titik simpan output AI
  sejak awal agar tidak perlu migrasi data.
endlegend
@enduml
